# Butler Routes - Dun Morogh rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 11 confirmed rares and the fixed world containers
# of Dun Morogh, Coldridge Valley included. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the
# end of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever); respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none
# are stated. Named mobs that are core-route quest objectives or quest-item
# sources (Grik'nir the Cold, Mangeclaw, Vagash, Old Frosthowl, Avala, Captain
# Beld, the Dark Iron Spy) are NOT here: the core guide covers their quests. See
# docs/dun-morogh-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dun-morogh-rares
title Dun Morogh - Rares & Treasures
levels 1-12
zone Dun Morogh
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords dun morogh, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

