  collect 10553 "Foreman Vest" optional
  collect 10554 "Foreman Pants" optional
  note Level 11 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Tunic, Wooden Buckler); respawn timer unconfirmed.

